window.__code__["runtime-executor-py"] = {"code_id": "runtime-executor-py", "kind": "src", "title": "executor.py", "source_path": "QwenPaw-main/src/qwenpaw/runtime/executor.py", "highlight_line": null, "code_html": "<div class=\"code-body\">\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"1\"><span class=\"c-no\">1</span><span class=\"c-src\"><span class=\"c-com\"># -*- coding: utf-8 -*-</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"2\"><span class=\"c-no\">2</span><span class=\"c-src\"><span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span>&quot;Agent execution driver.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"3\"><span class=\"c-no\">3</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"4\"><span class=\"c-no\">4</span><span class=\"c-src\">Drives ``agent.reply_stream(inputs=msgs)`` <span class=\"c-kw\">with</span> heartbeat wrapping</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"5\"><span class=\"c-no\">5</span><span class=\"c-src\"><span class=\"c-kw\">and</span> delegates each ``EventType`` event to ``Envelope.translate_event()``.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"6\"><span class=\"c-no\">6</span><span class=\"c-src\"><span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span>&quot;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"7\"><span class=\"c-no\">7</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"8\"><span class=\"c-no\">8</span><span class=\"c-src\"><span class=\"c-kw\">from</span> __future__ <span class=\"c-kw\">import</span> annotations</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"9\"><span class=\"c-no\">9</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"10\"><span class=\"c-no\">10</span><span class=\"c-src\"><span class=\"c-kw\">import</span> logging</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"11\"><span class=\"c-no\">11</span><span class=\"c-src\"><span class=\"c-kw\">from</span> typing <span class=\"c-kw\">import</span> Any, AsyncGenerator</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"12\"><span class=\"c-no\">12</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"13\"><span class=\"c-no\">13</span><span class=\"c-src\"><span class=\"c-kw\">from</span> .envelope <span class=\"c-kw\">import</span> Envelope</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"14\"><span class=\"c-no\">14</span><span class=\"c-src\"><span class=\"c-kw\">from</span> .heartbeat <span class=\"c-kw\">import</span> (</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"15\"><span class=\"c-no\">15</span><span class=\"c-src\">    _iter_with_heartbeat,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"16\"><span class=\"c-no\">16</span><span class=\"c-src\">    _HEARTBEAT_TICK,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"17\"><span class=\"c-no\">17</span><span class=\"c-src\">    HEARTBEAT_INTERVAL_SECONDS,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"18\"><span class=\"c-no\">18</span><span class=\"c-src\">)</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"19\"><span class=\"c-no\">19</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"20\"><span class=\"c-no\">20</span><span class=\"c-src\">logger = logging.getLogger(__name__)</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"21\"><span class=\"c-no\">21</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"22\"><span class=\"c-no\">22</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"23\"><span class=\"c-no\">23</span><span class=\"c-src\"><span class=\"c-kw\">class</span> AgentExecutor:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"24\"><span class=\"c-no\">24</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span>&quot;Execute the agent&<span class=\"c-com\">#x27;s reply stream and translate</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"25\"><span class=\"c-no\">25</span><span class=\"c-src\">    events into SSE envelopes.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"26\"><span class=\"c-no\">26</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"27\"><span class=\"c-no\">27</span><span class=\"c-src\">    One instance per ``Runtime.run()`` invocation.  The executor owns the</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"28\"><span class=\"c-no\">28</span><span class=\"c-src\">    heartbeat wrapper but <span class=\"c-kw\">not</span> the agent itself (that belongs to the</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"29\"><span class=\"c-no\">29</span><span class=\"c-src\">    ``HookContext``).</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"30\"><span class=\"c-no\">30</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span>&quot;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"31\"><span class=\"c-no\">31</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"32\"><span class=\"c-no\">32</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-kw\">def</span> __init__(<span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>, agent: Any, envelope: Envelope) -&gt; <span class=\"c-kw\">None</span>:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"33\"><span class=\"c-no\">33</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>._agent = agent</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"34\"><span class=\"c-no\">34</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>._envelope = envelope</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"35\"><span class=\"c-no\">35</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"36\"><span class=\"c-no\">36</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-kw\">async</span> <span class=\"c-kw\">def</span> run(</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"37\"><span class=\"c-no\">37</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"38\"><span class=\"c-no\">38</span><span class=\"c-src\">        msgs: list[Any],</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"39\"><span class=\"c-no\">39</span><span class=\"c-src\">    ) -&gt; AsyncGenerator[Any, <span class=\"c-kw\">None</span>]:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"40\"><span class=\"c-no\">40</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span>&quot;Drive ``agent.reply_stream`` <span class=\"c-kw\">and</span> <span class=\"c-kw\">yield</span> SSE envelope objects.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"41\"><span class=\"c-no\">41</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"42\"><span class=\"c-no\">42</span><span class=\"c-src\">        Wraps the raw event stream <span class=\"c-kw\">with</span> ``_iter_with_heartbeat`` so long</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"43\"><span class=\"c-no\">43</span><span class=\"c-src\">        idle periods (e.g. tool-guard approval waits) emit keep-alive</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"44\"><span class=\"c-no\">44</span><span class=\"c-src\">        envelopes instead of letting the connection drop.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"45\"><span class=\"c-no\">45</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span>&quot;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"46\"><span class=\"c-no\">46</span><span class=\"c-src\">        agent_iter = <span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>._agent.reply_stream(inputs=msgs).__aiter__()</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"47\"><span class=\"c-no\">47</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">async</span> <span class=\"c-kw\">for</span> event <span class=\"c-kw\">in</span> _iter_with_heartbeat(</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"48\"><span class=\"c-no\">48</span><span class=\"c-src\">            agent_iter,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"49\"><span class=\"c-no\">49</span><span class=\"c-src\">            HEARTBEAT_INTERVAL_SECONDS,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"50\"><span class=\"c-no\">50</span><span class=\"c-src\">        ):</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"51\"><span class=\"c-no\">51</span><span class=\"c-src\">            <span class=\"c-kw\">if</span> event <span class=\"c-kw\">is</span> _HEARTBEAT_TICK:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"52\"><span class=\"c-no\">52</span><span class=\"c-src\">                <span class=\"c-kw\">async</span> <span class=\"c-kw\">for</span> obj <span class=\"c-kw\">in</span> <span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>._envelope.heartbeat():</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"53\"><span class=\"c-no\">53</span><span class=\"c-src\">                    <span class=\"c-kw\">yield</span> obj</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"54\"><span class=\"c-no\">54</span><span class=\"c-src\">                <span class=\"c-kw\">continue</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"55\"><span class=\"c-no\">55</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"56\"><span class=\"c-no\">56</span><span class=\"c-src\">            <span class=\"c-kw\">async</span> <span class=\"c-kw\">for</span> obj <span class=\"c-kw\">in</span> <span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>._envelope.translate_event(event):</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"57\"><span class=\"c-no\">57</span><span class=\"c-src\">                <span class=\"c-kw\">yield</span> obj</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"58\"><span class=\"c-no\">58</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"59\"><span class=\"c-no\">59</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"60\"><span class=\"c-no\">60</span><span class=\"c-src\">__all__ = [<span class=\"c-str\">&quot;AgentExecutor&quot;</span>]</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"61\"><span class=\"c-no\">61</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n</div>", "lines": 61, "explanation": "QwenPaw AgentExecutor 用心跳包装 reply_stream：周期性发 keepalive 维持 SSE 长连接（防代理超时断开），把框架事件转给 Envelope。是『框架流→SSE 流』的搬运工+保活器。", "knowledge_points": [{"title": "Runtime 与 SSE 工业化", "body": "Envelope 状态机把碎 AgentEvent 翻译成带 seq 标准 SSE；Runtime 8 阶段可插拔 hook（鉴权/限流/审计）；AgentBuilder 依赖注入式组装。框架 reply_stream 是原料，这层是加工线。"}], "related_docs": ["README", "W09-Runtime与SSE状态机"]};
